  a request of 200 sectors behind a small one, stalls 1500/20, at the console's pace: opened a window and came through it in 107 events, the read behind it from the same window; streams begun 30, CMD18 30, CMD12 29
  a request of 150 sectors whose window failed after 40 of them: back to the low reader whole, read again from its first sector, data exact; the read behind it has a window
