  a request of 61 sectors at a window that holds them: two slices by its own visit, nothing asked of the wire, the rest by 1 CHECK call alone
  ordinary reads one behind the other: the second opens a window with no card command; 7 requests of 9 served from 2 windows, 167 sectors; the read of 61 sectors served from its window in slices; a window given up for a read elsewhere and one at the track's end; CMD18 3, CMD12 2
